#. Description of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php
msgid "The Barrio Suite forms in WPGraphQL, with the names of the previous plugin (hbForm, hbForms, hbSubmitForm), so headless frontends keep working unchanged."
msgstr "I form di Barrio Suite in WPGraphQL, con i nomi del plugin precedente (hbForm, hbForms, hbSubmitForm), così i frontend headless continuano a funzionare senza modifiche."

